# Google Gemini API Key (Optional)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If provided, the backend agent (diagnoser & playbooks) will execute real 
# REST calls to the Gemini-2.5-Flash model to generate dynamic Hinglish WhatsApp nudges 
# and custom failure "judgment stories".
#
# If left blank, the system automatically falls back to its high-fidelity 
# rule-based and template-based local simulation mode, ensuring full offline capability.
# 
# Usage: Copy this file to '.env' or set the variable in your terminal environment.
#
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
